  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2105.12 Personal Protective Equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2105.12 Personal Protective Equipment. No individual shall enter or be in a contaminated work area unless the individual uses personal protective equipment in conformance with the personal protective equipment requirements for asbestos workers established by the Occupational Safety and Health Administration in 29 CFR 1910 and 29 CFR 1926.\n\nSource. #7647, eff 2-16-02 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 2100) (formerly Env-Wm 3905.12); ss by #9645, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12605, eff 9-1-18",
